 releaseNotes: >-
-  Flix can be reached at several addresses at once, and the phone kept landing
-  on https://<device>:8096, where Umbrel's certificate only covers umbrel.local
-  and so always warned. Flix now sends every other address to the one HTTPS
-  address it is given by PUBLIC_URL, keeping the path and query.
-  Loopback and Docker-internal names are left alone, so nothing inside the box
-  is affected.
+  Made for the whole family. Each person gets a one-time sign-in link from the
+  admin (no password to type), and a shared phone or TV asks "Who's watching?";
+  a profile can have a PIN. Flix no longer sits behind Umbrel's own login, so
+  there is one sign-in, not two. Shows are listed only when their whole first
+  season is available, season packs are listed episode by episode and
+  downloaded whole so they can be seeded, and every episode now has a title,
+  summary and picture. Playback recovers by itself: a source that delivers
+  nothing is swapped for the next-best one, the next episode starts
+  downloading while you watch, and a flag in the player reports a problem to
+  the admin. Subtitles (embedded or .srt files), audio language, Skip intro,
+  10-second jumps and HDR tone-mapping are in. Home has My List, Because you
+  watched, Up next and New episode badges, and works with a TV remote. The
+  admin sees storage, BTN and seeding health on the Torrents page, with a
+  banner when something needs attention, and the database is backed up daily.
